{"schema":1,"docId":"constitution","locale":"zh","contentVersion":"legal-lab-2026-10-15.2","id":2,"start":128,"units":[{"id":"constitution-u1002b2c96c8cea5c4a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s38","locator":"第33条","text":"第33条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/33eccb6261e315af07ad7d39f68d5bc470b60707/","label":"第33条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u1ea587483f29b0a796-1","sectionId":"constitution-s38","locator":"第33条","text":"俄罗斯联邦公民有权亲自向国家机关和地方自治机关提出诉求，也有权提交个人或集体诉求。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/33eccb6261e315af07ad7d39f68d5bc470b60707/","label":"第33条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ubf0d4e9dc1d970a2ee-1","sectionId":"constitution-s39","locator":"第34条","text":"第34条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b841daa03c45d4e22a709bc1d0e6aa22f6f954fe/","label":"第34条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u5b67e7d44d0824f7f3-1","sectionId":"constitution-s39","locator":"第34条","text":"1. 人人有权自由运用自身能力和财产，从事经营活动及法律未禁止的其他经济活动。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b841daa03c45d4e22a709bc1d0e6aa22f6f954fe/","label":"第1款 第34条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0bbf93e7106a24e445-1","sectionId":"constitution-s39","locator":"第34条","text":"2. 不得从事旨在形成垄断或进行不正当竞争的经济活动。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/b841daa03c45d4e22a709bc1d0e6aa22f6f954fe/","label":"第2款 第34条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf7d2c967b1fe51c291-1","sectionId":"constitution-s40","locator":"第35条","text":"第35条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2b3cdfcf41099657639e96a77b00849cacec38ca/","label":"第35条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u819d3e9e34991bf745-1","sectionId":"constitution-s40","locator":"第35条","text":"1. 私有财产权受法律保护。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2b3cdfcf41099657639e96a77b00849cacec38ca/","label":"第1款 第35条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u6bfc6b75842242fafb-1","sectionId":"constitution-s40","locator":"第35条","text":"2. 人人有权拥有财产，并单独或与他人共同占有、使用和处分该财产。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2b3cdfcf41099657639e96a77b00849cacec38ca/","label":"第2款 第35条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud5808db3d328a744b8-1","sectionId":"constitution-s40","locator":"第35条","text":"3. 非经法院决定，不得剥夺任何人的财产。为国家需要而强制征收财产，只有在事先给予等值补偿的条件下方可进行。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2b3cdfcf41099657639e96a77b00849cacec38ca/","label":"第3款 第35条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ude7a04ab171f8a3ed6-1","sectionId":"constitution-s40","locator":"第35条","text":"4. 保障继承权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2b3cdfcf41099657639e96a77b00849cacec38ca/","label":"第4款 第35条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uf353bef6d027b7c286-1","sectionId":"constitution-s41","locator":"第36条","text":"第36条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/521d00a99406a75eb913f7336d02b6ff378f3e7a/","label":"第36条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ub4d15f63c9d8e9fbb3-1","sectionId":"constitution-s41","locator":"第36条","text":"1. 公民及其团体有权私有土地。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/521d00a99406a75eb913f7336d02b6ff378f3e7a/","label":"第1款 第36条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u4b9b0a6be3e712270a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s41","locator":"第36条","text":"2. 土地和其他自然资源的所有人，可以自由占有、使用和处分土地及其他自然资源，但不得损害环境，不得侵犯他人的权利和合法利益。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/521d00a99406a75eb913f7336d02b6ff378f3e7a/","label":"第2款 第36条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u13bc3c316a0b6cf74d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s41","locator":"第36条","text":"3. 土地使用的条件和程序依据联邦法律确定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/521d00a99406a75eb913f7336d02b6ff378f3e7a/","label":"第3款 第36条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uece093e7db19b4a925-1","sectionId":"constitution-s42","locator":"第37条","text":"第37条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5e37b9644c66582efdaf762a109a281bf999c28d/","label":"第37条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u265fb357594d2812d7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s42","locator":"第37条","text":"1. 劳动是自由的。人人有权自由支配自己的劳动能力，选择活动种类和职业。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5e37b9644c66582efdaf762a109a281bf999c28d/","label":"第1款 第37条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u0bef0681b21a1662c2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s42","locator":"第37条","text":"2. 禁止强迫劳动。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5e37b9644c66582efdaf762a109a281bf999c28d/","label":"第2款 第37条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u3ab9aa66a3c9ef3c16-1","sectionId":"constitution-s42","locator":"第37条","text":"3. 人人有权在符合安全和卫生要求的条件下劳动，有权不受任何歧视地获得不低于联邦法律规定最低工资的劳动报酬，并有权获得失业保障。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5e37b9644c66582efdaf762a109a281bf999c28d/","label":"第3款 第37条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9948363521ab82afda-1","sectionId":"constitution-s42","locator":"第37条","text":"4. 承认通过联邦法律规定的解决方式处理个人和集体劳动争议的权利，包括罢工权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5e37b9644c66582efdaf762a109a281bf999c28d/","label":"第4款 第37条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uaac2185754289a2050-1","sectionId":"constitution-s42","locator":"第37条","text":"5. 人人享有休息权。对按劳动合同工作的人，保障其享有联邦法律规定的工作时间、休息日、节假日和带薪年假。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/5e37b9644c66582efdaf762a109a281bf999c28d/","label":"第5款 第37条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uc2005973ce98e3f84f-1","sectionId":"constitution-s43","locator":"第38条","text":"第38条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/58e82f7427fb7280ac3860e0176dcd68d75f2546/","label":"第38条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud6bd69a2bd8f37b927-1","sectionId":"constitution-s43","locator":"第38条","text":"1. 母亲、儿童和家庭受国家保护。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/58e82f7427fb7280ac3860e0176dcd68d75f2546/","label":"第1款 第38条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u57ec9e1a8fd63194c5-1","sectionId":"constitution-s43","locator":"第38条","text":"2. 照顾和养育子女是父母平等的权利和义务。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/58e82f7427fb7280ac3860e0176dcd68d75f2546/","label":"第2款 第38条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u93f9835d2b1707f3e3-1","sectionId":"constitution-s43","locator":"第38条","text":"3. 年满18岁的有劳动能力子女必须照顾丧失劳动能力的父母。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/58e82f7427fb7280ac3860e0176dcd68d75f2546/","label":"第3款 第38条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u06ce717f827e0b4d14-1","sectionId":"constitution-s44","locator":"第39条","text":"第39条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/fe434e420c3130424bbee0b97bc794f0e96c3081/","label":"第39条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u82de1986c21adf8eac-1","sectionId":"constitution-s44","locator":"第39条","text":"1. 保障每个人在年老、患病、残疾、丧失抚养人、养育子女及法律规定的其他情况下获得社会保障。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/fe434e420c3130424bbee0b97bc794f0e96c3081/","label":"第1款 第39条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u79fe76b9ae08d2e4e1-1","sectionId":"constitution-s44","locator":"第39条","text":"2. 国家养老金和社会补助由法律规定。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/fe434e420c3130424bbee0b97bc794f0e96c3081/","label":"第2款 第39条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u59b02f140a346d692c-1","sectionId":"constitution-s44","locator":"第39条","text":"3. 鼓励自愿社会保险、创设补充社会保障形式和慈善活动。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/fe434e420c3130424bbee0b97bc794f0e96c3081/","label":"第3款 第39条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u534d5a8a669faf9a50-1","sectionId":"constitution-s45","locator":"第40条","text":"第40条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d54c3955f5a6b8840a9141245a4bae9ad7d531b1/","label":"第40条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ud6078d9e1a962a3428-1","sectionId":"constitution-s45","locator":"第40条","text":"1. 人人享有住房权。不得任意剥夺任何人的住房。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d54c3955f5a6b8840a9141245a4bae9ad7d531b1/","label":"第1款 第40条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u37cc440ac62471fc09-1","sectionId":"constitution-s45","locator":"第40条","text":"2. 国家权力机关和地方自治机关鼓励住房建设，为实现住房权创造条件。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d54c3955f5a6b8840a9141245a4bae9ad7d531b1/","label":"第2款 第40条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud05a25171da89039a0-1","sectionId":"constitution-s45","locator":"第40条","text":"3. 对需要住房的低收入公民及法律规定的其他公民，按照法律规定的标准，从国家、市政及其他住房储备中免费或以可负担的价格提供住房。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/d54c3955f5a6b8840a9141245a4bae9ad7d531b1/","label":"第3款 第40条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua25cd659226fe54e4a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s46","locator":"第41条","text":"第41条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8c815f376c72a61b3df7905bb5aae9f144d2cb0d/","label":"第41条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-uf5e4e143dbd1f23a2d-1","sectionId":"constitution-s46","locator":"第41条","text":"1. 人人享有健康保护和医疗救助的权利。国家和市政医疗卫生机构以相应预算资金、保险费及其他收入为来源，免费向公民提供医疗服务。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8c815f376c72a61b3df7905bb5aae9f144d2cb0d/","label":"第1款 第41条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u42c4b09a4bb301f181-1","sectionId":"constitution-s46","locator":"第41条","text":"2. 俄罗斯联邦为保护和增进居民健康的联邦计划提供资金，采取措施发展国家、市政和私人医疗卫生体系，鼓励有助于增进人的健康、发展体育运动、保障生态环境及卫生防疫安全的活动。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8c815f376c72a61b3df7905bb5aae9f144d2cb0d/","label":"第2款 第41条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u95584aa5225ac410d2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s46","locator":"第41条","text":"3. 公职人员隐瞒对人的生命和健康构成威胁的事实和情况，应依联邦法律承担责任。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8c815f376c72a61b3df7905bb5aae9f144d2cb0d/","label":"第3款 第41条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u073ec17ccd442c5450-1","sectionId":"constitution-s47","locator":"第42条","text":"第42条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2b65ae24cc8141d4720fb749fb0c5583f8395048/","label":"第42条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u16bc9c9ab04fb612c5-1","sectionId":"constitution-s47","locator":"第42条","text":"人人享有良好环境、获取有关环境状况真实信息的权利，并有权就环境违法行为造成的健康或财产损害获得赔偿。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/2b65ae24cc8141d4720fb749fb0c5583f8395048/","label":"第42条 · 正文","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue003347e3699c5ad66-1","sectionId":"constitution-s48","locator":"第43条","text":"第43条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8452df644dd1f63f07ca7744f87beddac2947282/","label":"第43条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u18919aef56780cf68b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s48","locator":"第43条","text":"1. 人人享有受教育权。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8452df644dd1f63f07ca7744f87beddac2947282/","label":"第1款 第43条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uea086d7ba3e83140f7-1","sectionId":"constitution-s48","locator":"第43条","text":"2. 保障国家或市政教育机构及企业中的学前教育、基础普通教育和中等职业教育普遍可及且免费。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8452df644dd1f63f07ca7744f87beddac2947282/","label":"第2款 第43条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u8b5f16605b67ca4a10-1","sectionId":"constitution-s48","locator":"第43条","text":"3. 人人有权通过竞争，在国家或市政教育机构及企业中免费接受高等教育。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8452df644dd1f63f07ca7744f87beddac2947282/","label":"第3款 第43条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ue32664de74ad9ea102-1","sectionId":"constitution-s48","locator":"第43条","text":"4. 基础普通教育为义务教育。父母或代替父母的人，应保障儿童接受基础普通教育。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8452df644dd1f63f07ca7744f87beddac2947282/","label":"第4款 第43条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-udb87d7258687c7a359-1","sectionId":"constitution-s48","locator":"第43条","text":"5. 俄罗斯联邦制定联邦国家教育标准，支持各种形式的教育和自学。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/8452df644dd1f63f07ca7744f87beddac2947282/","label":"第5款 第43条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9ab6798cc63e533115-1","sectionId":"constitution-s49","locator":"第44条","text":"第44条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ccca0bbf3250f82d26aa158e6325aa2b34775e8d/","label":"第44条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u4a0690e66a80d6e4f2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s49","locator":"第44条","text":"1. 保障人人享有文学、艺术、科学、技术及其他创作和教学自由。知识产权受法律保护。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ccca0bbf3250f82d26aa158e6325aa2b34775e8d/","label":"第1款 第44条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua77096eab0ffafd7c2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s49","locator":"第44条","text":"2. 人人有权参与文化生活、使用文化机构并接触文化财富。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ccca0bbf3250f82d26aa158e6325aa2b34775e8d/","label":"第2款 第44条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u81aa91ed16b7ba4517-1","sectionId":"constitution-s49","locator":"第44条","text":"3. 人人有义务维护历史文化遗产，爱护历史文化古迹。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/ccca0bbf3250f82d26aa158e6325aa2b34775e8d/","label":"第3款 第44条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u3ef81828a79180676a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s50","locator":"第45条","text":"第45条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e8d3411eef83427471ae3409d62570cd0ae3b62a/","label":"第45条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ue0ab2462af48d49a50-1","sectionId":"constitution-s50","locator":"第45条","text":"1. 保障俄罗斯联邦国家对人和公民权利与自由的保护。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e8d3411eef83427471ae3409d62570cd0ae3b62a/","label":"第1款 第45条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u9e84023ece5baf23b1-1","sectionId":"constitution-s50","locator":"第45条","text":"2. 人人有权通过法律未禁止的一切方式保护自己的权利与自由。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/e8d3411eef83427471ae3409d62570cd0ae3b62a/","label":"第2款 第45条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u2638bda038e8bcfcb0-1","sectionId":"constitution-s51","locator":"第46条","text":"第46条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1f1ca1e76ebdb70979b8aefe86b441f7cd9373e3/","label":"第46条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u81c7b87d9ab21f6ea2-1","sectionId":"constitution-s51","locator":"第46条","text":"1. 保障人人的权利与自由受到司法保护。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1f1ca1e76ebdb70979b8aefe86b441f7cd9373e3/","label":"第1款 第46条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u5663d3fbc5d2fa88be-1","sectionId":"constitution-s51","locator":"第46条","text":"2. 对国家权力机关、地方自治机关、社会团体和公职人员的决定、行为（或不作为），可以向法院提起申诉。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1f1ca1e76ebdb70979b8aefe86b441f7cd9373e3/","label":"第2款 第46条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u8c944eb2069ce4b666-1","sectionId":"constitution-s51","locator":"第46条","text":"3. 在用尽所有现有国内法律救济手段后，人人有权依俄罗斯联邦国际条约，向保护人权与自由的国家间机构提出申诉。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/1f1ca1e76ebdb70979b8aefe86b441f7cd9373e3/","label":"第3款 第46条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-u7074477fd07bbf1551-1","sectionId":"constitution-s52","locator":"第47条","text":"第47条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a2ae88fffa093e36496f4c6789a00e5f2956e1c9/","label":"第47条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u4b48b095b1d0f8e918-1","sectionId":"constitution-s52","locator":"第47条","text":"1. 不得剥夺任何人由法律规定具有管辖权的法院和法官审理其案件的权利。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a2ae88fffa093e36496f4c6789a00e5f2956e1c9/","label":"第1款 第47条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uddddebdcda71a2083a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s52","locator":"第47条","text":"2. 被指控犯罪的人，在联邦法律规定的情形下，有权由有陪审员参与的法院审理其案件。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/a2ae88fffa093e36496f4c6789a00e5f2956e1c9/","label":"第2款 第47条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uda3400b889eaf48604-1","sectionId":"constitution-s53","locator":"第48条","text":"第48条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/78dcbb89fb8a04e896d5863e68edd708540f844c/","label":"第48条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-ub3b27f8fc27f0cb05a-1","sectionId":"constitution-s53","locator":"第48条","text":"1. 保障人人获得专业法律帮助的权利。在法律规定的情形下，免费提供法律帮助。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/78dcbb89fb8a04e896d5863e68edd708540f844c/","label":"第1款 第48条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-uea42c5c02fa533779b-1","sectionId":"constitution-s53","locator":"第48条","text":"2. 每一被拘留、被羁押或被指控犯罪的人，自被拘留、被羁押或被提出指控之时起，分别有权获得律师（辩护人）的帮助。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/78dcbb89fb8a04e896d5863e68edd708540f844c/","label":"第2款 第48条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ud2d11f450006796b45-1","sectionId":"constitution-s54","locator":"第49条","text":"第49条","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/780291ec1777fd4e50e27106bea5925f70f298c7/","label":"第49条","heading":true},{"id":"constitution-u0e81990f13f3a6e939-1","sectionId":"constitution-s54","locator":"第49条","text":"1. 每一被指控犯罪的人，在依联邦法律规定程序证明其有罪并由已发生法律效力的法院判决认定之前，均被视为无罪。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/780291ec1777fd4e50e27106bea5925f70f298c7/","label":"第1款 第49条","heading":false},{"id":"constitution-ua866789a1d393c5c3e-1","sectionId":"constitution-s54","locator":"第49条","text":"2. 被告人没有证明自己无罪的义务。","sourceUrl":"https://www.consultant.ru/document/cons_doc_LAW_28399/780291ec1777fd4e50e27106bea5925f70f298c7/","label":"第2款 第49条","heading":false}]}
